  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We manufacture sign structures to order right in our own production facilities. Experienced metalworkers deliver precise craftsmanship from the first design to the final build, with the emphasis on strength, function and a long service life.",
   "anchor": "zamecnicke-konstrukce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Materials: we have the technology for welding, bending and other metal machining. We work with materials such as iron, steel, aluminium and stainless steel, to suit the specific requirements of the project and the applicable standards.",
   "anchor": "zamecnicke-konstrukce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Installation: we install every structure with structural stability in mind, safety and long-term durability, so that the finished solution works reliably in any environment.",
   "anchor": "zamecnicke-konstrukce"
  },
