   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Non-standard metal structures",
   "anchor": "atypicke-zamecnicke-konstrukce"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "We deliver a wide range of non-standard solutions that call for an individual approach, technical know-how and genuine craftsmanship. We adapt every project to your requirements, to the way it will be used and to the environment it will stand in.",
   "anchor": "atypicke-zamecnicke-konstrukce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Typical projects: football dugouts and goals, bus shelters, canopies and pergolas, railings and more.",
   "anchor": "atypicke-zamecnicke-konstrukce"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Materials and technology: we have the technology for welding, bending and other metal machining. We work with materials such as iron, steel, aluminium and stainless steel, always to suit the specific requirements of the project and the intended use of the structure.",
   "anchor": "atypicke-zamecnicke-konstrukce"
  },
